q
.090196 .105882 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 83 Tm /F4 10 Tf 15.5 TL (These scales are needed because each solves a different failure. Without briefs, agents act on ambiguous) Tj T* (requests. Without desks, handoffs and checks become ad hoc. Without cells, an organization lacks a clear) Tj T* (boundary for ownership, capacity and policy. Without continuing subjects, it loses the relationship between) Tj T* (delivered work and the system it was meant to improve. Without measurements and cadences, it cannot) Tj T* (distinguish useful progress from activity. Without controlled interoperation, local efficiency can produce) Tj T* (organization-wide confusion.) Tj T* ET
